{"words": [{"text": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "That"}, {"text": "مِنْ", "translation": "(is) from"}, {"text": "أَنۢبَآءِ", "translation": "(the) news"}, {"text": "ٱلْغَيْبِ", "translation": "(of) the unseen "}, {"text": "نُوحِيهِ", "translation": "We reveal it"}, {"text": "إِلَيْكَ ۚ", "translation": "to you"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "And not"}, {"text": "كُنتَ", "translation": "you were"}, {"text": "لَدَيْهِمْ", "translation": "with them"}, {"text": "إِذْ", "translation": "when"}, {"text": "يُلْقُونَ", "translation": "they cast"}, {"text": "أَقْلَـٰمَهُمْ", "translation": "their pens"}, {"text": "أَيُّهُمْ", "translation": "(as to) which of them"}, {"text": "يَكْفُلُ", "translation": "takes charge (of)"}, {"text": "مَرْيَمَ", "translation": "Maryam"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "كُنتَ", "translation": "you were"}, {"text": "لَدَيْهِمْ", "translation": "with them"}, {"text": "إِذْ", "translation": "when"}, {"text": "يَخْتَصِمُونَ", "translation": "they (were) disputing"}], "sahih": "That is from the news of the unseen which We reveal to you, [O Muḥammad]. And you were not with them when they cast their pens1 as to which of them should be responsible for Mary. Nor were you with them when they disputed."}